    {
      "id": "UoDehGgokp0AF2PFxmxe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 104.25884016973126,
      "y": 4478.5,
      "width": 286.0,
      "height": 25.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 378012328,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 483858866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L'âge limite des orphelins",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'âge limite des orphelins",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MMpifSGMHNX1MY4YBApP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4526.5,
      "width": 752.0,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2103319918,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 803934062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : le recueil des besoins de la CNSS ne compte dans T35 que les orphelins de\nmoins de 25 ans.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : le recueil des besoins de la CNSS ne compte dans T35 que les orphelins de\nmoins de 25 ans.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6AYxhPqwDwJ2rZSRj1sy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4574.5,
      "width": 694.72,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1463632276,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1380092944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : les pensions d'orphelin (PRESTATION_ESP, code RPSE) et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : les pensions d'orphelin (PRESTATION_ESP, code RPSE) et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cqyuKgZl66tLyOhSjOH5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4622.5,
      "width": 795.0400000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1352100222,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 180305872,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : au 31/12, T35 s'arrête à 24 ans. Pour les nouveaux orphelins de l'année (T44,\nT46), pas de limite : un orphelin de 25 ans ou plus va dans « 20 ans et plus ».",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : au 31/12, T35 s'arrête à 24 ans. Pour les nouveaux orphelins de l'année (T44,\nT46), pas de limite : un orphelin de 25 ans ou plus va dans « 20 ans et plus ».",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IqXWFog4ewSE8mZs7BZr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4670.5,
      "width": 785.12,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 656022007,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1565738817,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 fait pareil au 31/12 : ses 9 478 orphelins ont tous moins\nde 25 ans. En 2024, 2 nouveaux orphelins pensionnés (T44) ont de 25 à 29 ans.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 fait pareil au 31/12 : ses 9 478 orphelins ont tous moins\nde 25 ans. En 2024, 2 nouveaux orphelins pensionnés (T44) ont de 25 à 29 ans.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EbnOKZXuFmahAefYVMJa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4718.5,
      "width": 101.76,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 520060785,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 973444604,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DMFuucHACwqixN7W3RKh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4746.5,
      "width": 784.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vClMds7dvTjBXegJcPvE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 270510897,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 733988647,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question : un orphelin de 25 ans ou plus peut-il recevoir une nouvelle pension d'orphelin ?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Question : un orphelin de 25 ans ou plus peut-il recevoir une nouvelle pension d'orphelin ?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
