      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les refus",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les refus",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PNwGYmxu10ElCIcCNhk6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 7102.5,
      "width": 750.08,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3eEM377HAgzPILZHNXZM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 245679073,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 734357382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : un dossier refusé n'est plus en instance et n'a pas de durée de liquidation.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : un dossier refusé n'est plus en instance et n'a pas de durée de liquidation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JNLdq8iYRXiuQkEGEDnm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 7130.5,
      "width": 792.32,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3eEM377HAgzPILZHNXZM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 325859652,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 286508494,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : le module des rejets (DOSSIER_REJETE), l'année du rejet\n(DOSRE_DATE_REJET). Ni le statut de la réception, ni la fermeture du dossier ne valent\nrefus.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : le module des rejets (DOSSIER_REJETE), l'année du rejet\n(DOSRE_DATE_REJET). Ni le statut de la réception, ni la fermeture du dossier ne valent\nrefus.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "24MyVKVWzJJWtZPHB3Y0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 7198.5,
      "width": 796.8000000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3eEM377HAgzPILZHNXZM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 626534115,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 909917511,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : un refus non saisi dans le module reste en instance. L'atelier de Kaya en 2017\nnotait déjà que le module n'est pas exploité.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : un refus non saisi dans le module reste en instance. L'atelier de Kaya en 2017\nnotait déjà que le module n'est pas exploité.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yrf4cMnAb0Byd4PcZCgR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 7246.5,
      "width": 802.24,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3eEM377HAgzPILZHNXZM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1782856995,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 123376597,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : 14 rejets de pension en 2025 pour 4 671 réceptions ; 21 en prestations familiales\nen 2025 pour 14 306 réceptions.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : 14 rejets de pension en 2025 pour 4 671 réceptions ; 21 en prestations familiales\nen 2025 pour 14 306 réceptions.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wvpjNxwVbRi3RGURgqDX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 7294.5,
      "width": 218.56,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3eEM377HAgzPILZHNXZM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 819103417,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 735876887,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
