      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Le recouvrement d'un indu (T31)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Le recouvrement d'un indu (T31)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "meMMjihUSDA65x6V0QE2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 10542.5,
      "width": 783.6800000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "5imckgJAiMJCKdTi1bgN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 293798185,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1690704407,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : un trop-perçu est repris peu à peu par des retenues sur les paiements suivants,\nou remboursé par l'assuré.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : un trop-perçu est repris peu à peu par des retenues sur les paiements suivants,\nou remboursé par l'assuré.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vSaNGdYeco96axStsqs7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 10590.5,
      "width": 802.08,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "5imckgJAiMJCKdTi1bgN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 153434294,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1022866520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : dans AJUSTEMENT, depuis 2017, aucun trop-perçu n'est soldé (AJ_STATUT\n= C), tous restent en cours (voir le point 61). Les remboursements ont leur code, TAJ_CODE\n= REM-TP.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : dans AJUSTEMENT, depuis 2017, aucun trop-perçu n'est soldé (AJ_STATUT\n= C), tous restent en cours (voir le point 61). Les remboursements ont leur code, TAJ_CODE\n= REM-TP.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RED7GUbtQcfxKPzIWjUk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 10658.5,
      "width": 604.48,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "5imckgJAiMJCKdTi1bgN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1396957258,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1459853888,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : un remboursement ne diminue pas les trop-perçus de T31.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : un remboursement ne diminue pas les trop-perçus de T31.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1gCJtOe7AEVwcTsoFxJ9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 10686.5,
      "width": 748.96,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "5imckgJAiMJCKdTi1bgN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1266842831,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1531807411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : en 2024, 13,0 M de remboursements pour 229,5 M de trop-perçus. Les déduire\nferait passer le taux d'indus de 0,39 % à 0,37 %.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : en 2024, 13,0 M de remboursements pour 229,5 M de trop-perçus. Les déduire\nferait passer le taux d'indus de 0,39 % à 0,37 %.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BmtqsZ7SBsZGzShQL0lA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 10734.5,
      "width": 218.56,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "5imckgJAiMJCKdTi1bgN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1992434294,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2001871285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP, avec la DSI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
