      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les trop-perçus sur convention (T31)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les trop-perçus sur convention (T31)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ccOjUf0MnW2aXjLOgCFE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 11530.5,
      "width": 744.32,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "G82phY2hgiw1WvPSj1gk"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 836990214,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1606690548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : un trop-perçu sur convention est une somme payée en trop sur un dossier de\ncoordination avec la caisse d'un autre pays.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : un trop-perçu sur convention est une somme payée en trop sur un dossier de\ncoordination avec la caisse d'un autre pays.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s98Qj0V6QQSivcTiTNpZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 11578.5,
      "width": 692.64,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "G82phY2hgiw1WvPSj1gk"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1174925805,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1553757320,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : AJUSTEMENT, TAJ_CODE = TP-CONV, par date d'établissement\n(AJ_DATE_ETABLISSEMENT).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : AJUSTEMENT, TAJ_CODE = TP-CONV, par date d'établissement\n(AJ_DATE_ETABLISSEMENT).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Qo1Bic7q6Nmig3vQT7bH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 11626.5,
      "width": 698.5600000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
