      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L'allocation prénatale seule (T41)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'allocation prénatale seule (T41)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7E2hPceExbfnCzfwjRRz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 13388.5,
      "width": 735.36,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7WxrNJrww8qD5IKLXaE4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1696128976,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 782017502,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : l'allocation prénatale est versée à une future mère pendant sa grossesse.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : l'allocation prénatale est versée à une future mère pendant sa grossesse.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "z34zzSsLHy2oh3AedsNm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 13416.5,
      "width": 799.6800000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7WxrNJrww8qD5IKLXaE4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1830336374,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2018027742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : T41 ne prend que les allocations familiales (PRESTATION_ESP, code FAF),\npas les prénatales (codes FAP et MAP).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : T41 ne prend que les allocations familiales (PRESTATION_ESP, code FAF),\npas les prénatales (codes FAP et MAP).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fEgFzUfAo6FnR0G8bTLR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 13464.5,
      "width": 764.8000000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7WxrNJrww8qD5IKLXaE4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1012879061,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 224790955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : une femme qui ne touche que l'allocation prénatale n'est pas allocataire de\nT41.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : une femme qui ne touche que l'allocation prénatale n'est pas allocataire de\nT41.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
