      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les invalides âgés (T33)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les invalides âgés (T33)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gv2wNKkmXgQExiHhD7G1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 14336.5,
      "width": 793.9200000000001,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "gdF0gWzYIsQiN2GurJno"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1092852472,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 386415652,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : la loi veut qu'une pension d'invalidité devienne une pension de vieillesse à\nl'âge de la retraite. L'application ne le fait pas ; le recueil des besoins demande un module\npour cela (une fonction de l'application qui ferait le changement).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : la loi veut qu'une pension d'invalidité devienne une pension de vieillesse à\nl'âge de la retraite. L'application ne le fait pas ; le recueil des besoins demande un module\npour cela (une fonction de l'application qui ferait le changement).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6U2PC0wIj42gDkQKsjDo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 14404.5,
      "width": 713.92,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "gdF0gWzYIsQiN2GurJno"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 24407391,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1612598310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code RPI, et l'âge (IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code RPI, et l'âge (IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LVTnaH6aB35O3AcAJFkq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 14432.5,
      "width": 689.9200000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "gdF0gWzYIsQiN2GurJno"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 302530511,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 645439318,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on les garde dans T33, ligne « 60 ans et + », comme l'application.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on les garde dans T33, ligne « 60 ans et + », comme l'application.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7t42daMQNYabG2wkgTCu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 14460.5,
      "width": 766.08,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "gdF0gWzYIsQiN2GurJno"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 587489458,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1165065953,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : en 2024, 72 des 125 invalides ont 60 ans et plus. L'annuaire CNSS 2024 fait\npareil : 70 sur 119.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : en 2024, 72 des 125 invalides ont 60 ans et plus. L'annuaire CNSS 2024 fait\npareil : 70 sur 119.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KBDGe97jRJnOvlfcUMxL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 14508.5,
      "width": 101.76,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "gdF0gWzYIsQiN2GurJno"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1907218143,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 443609393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DCP",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DCP",
      "autoResize": true,
