      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58188575,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2057945592,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : quand une victime d'accident du travail décède, ses orphelins reçoivent une\nrente. Ni le recueil des besoins ni l'atelier de Kaya en 2017 ne disent jusqu'à quel âge.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : quand une victime d'accident du travail décède, ses orphelins reçoivent une\nrente. Ni le recueil des besoins ni l'atelier de Kaya en 2017 ne disent jusqu'à quel âge.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gNWATQfuwyi4IDsQE6jD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 14848.5,
      "width": 647.36,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "zbqqcdgMI1WuDUNMu6e4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 902755847,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1126127902,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code ARSE, en cours au 31/12, et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code ARSE, en cours au 31/12, et l'âge\n(IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vVuwyjJZGoMjsi0jf1ik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 14896.5,
      "width": 782.5600000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
