      "text": "Les orphelins jamais radiés (T35)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les orphelins jamais radiés (T35)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iLMkCCRkmL0BAY3Uv377",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 15264.5,
      "width": 805.2800000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "FHDjegWmcWYSUmxJ8ymn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2049377613,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 723540036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : une pension d'orphelin s'arrête à 25 ans ; elle devrait alors être radiée, arrêtée\npour de bon.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : une pension d'orphelin s'arrête à 25 ans ; elle devrait alors être radiée, arrêtée\npour de bon.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4rIU0ddSxA0mHBxPj0I6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 15312.5,
      "width": 604.48,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "FHDjegWmcWYSUmxJ8ymn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1239415795,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1837492373,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code RPSE, sans date de radiation\n(PE_DATE_RADIATION), orphelin de 25 ans ou plus.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : PRESTATION_ESP, code RPSE, sans date de radiation\n(PE_DATE_RADIATION), orphelin de 25 ans ou plus.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KCIBHoTRpGSNejiWBWPV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 15360.5,
      "width": 707.0400000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "FHDjegWmcWYSUmxJ8ymn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 937058062,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1483333404,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : T35 ne les compte pas (voir le point 10) ; on les signale seulement.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : T35 ne les compte pas (voir le point 10) ; on les signale seulement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4ncO3IcXAlDQylAkZHJp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 15388.5,
      "width": 783.5200000000001,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "FHDjegWmcWYSUmxJ8ymn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695096007,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 841721152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : fin 2024, 5 774 pensions d'orphelin de 25 ans et plus encore en cours, presque\njamais payées. Fin 2025, 8 447 pensions d'orphelin actives sans aucun paiement au dernier\ntrimestre.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : fin 2024, 5 774 pensions d'orphelin de 25 ans et plus encore en cours, presque\njamais payées. Fin 2025, 8 447 pensions d'orphelin actives sans aucun paiement au dernier\ntrimestre.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
