      "text": "La dernière tranche d'âge (T43)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "La dernière tranche d'âge (T43)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s5yZ4GxsIhaLumJMkCVg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 17210.5,
      "width": 773.2800000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ricbsLYASrRUD2k05P2v"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 307256644,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1032738407,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : la grille de T43, les nouveaux veufs et veuves, s'arrête à « 60 ans et plus ».",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : la grille de T43, les nouveaux veufs et veuves, s'arrête à « 60 ans et plus ».",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tfN0bzN984ncoaucL4nc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 17238.5,
      "width": 723.2,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ricbsLYASrRUD2k05P2v"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 477368311,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 17754666,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : pensions RPSV et RPSF (PRESTATION_ESP), âge tiré de la date de\nnaissance (IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : pensions RPSV et RPSF (PRESTATION_ESP), âge tiré de la date de\nnaissance (IND_DATE_NAISSANCE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PKaVn0y3FTD1tQ1ffWhm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 17286.5,
      "width": 589.44,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ricbsLYASrRUD2k05P2v"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 364460936,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1669690804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on garde la grille de l'Annuaire CIPRES telle quelle.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on garde la grille de l'Annuaire CIPRES telle quelle.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UwYBzrpuESdWpSiS8VBV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 17314.5,
      "width": 767.2,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ricbsLYASrRUD2k05P2v"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2053613045,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 90223953,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : 413 des 772 nouveaux veufs et veuves saisis en 2024 (53 %) tombent dans cette\ntranche.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : 413 des 772 nouveaux veufs et veuves saisis en 2024 (53 %) tombent dans cette\ntranche.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kbybG3TjwS3S7usNLy1o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 17362.5,
      "width": 218.56,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
