      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Le taux d'incapacité (T48)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Le taux d'incapacité (T48)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JlPYOOh0JLAQEskfhKBW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17666.5,
      "width": 794.24,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1956560668,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 586590562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : l'IPP (incapacité permanente partielle) est le taux d'incapacité de la victime,\nen %. Pour T48, le recueil demande la moyenne des taux de chaque tranche ; une rente peut\nêtre recalculée dans l'année avec un autre taux.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : l'IPP (incapacité permanente partielle) est le taux d'incapacité de la victime,\nen %. Pour T48, le recueil demande la moyenne des taux de chaque tranche ; une rente peut\nêtre recalculée dans l'année avec un autre taux.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WqdViZdhXKZYYYOiapRQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17734.5,
      "width": 650.5600000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1037558219,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1591206029,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : la rente viagère (PRESTATION_ESP, code ARI) et son taux\n(PE_TAUX_INCAPACITE).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : la rente viagère (PRESTATION_ESP, code ARI) et son taux\n(PE_TAUX_INCAPACITE).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oocslCy32ny3NlYrHRcP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17782.5,
      "width": 600.6400000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 598622959,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 332212033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on prend le taux de la dernière rente viagère de l'année.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on prend le taux de la dernière rente viagère de l'année.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HzWklYX25LrCBV1yydlC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17810.5,
      "width": 801.9200000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 183622460,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 599494408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : de 2020 à 2025, le taux va de 15 à 100 %. Parmi les 39 nouveaux de 2024, au plus\n1 personne a eu deux rentes dans l'année.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : de 2020 à 2025, le taux va de 15 à 100 %. Parmi les 39 nouveaux de 2024, au plus\n1 personne a eu deux rentes dans l'année.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1wEaB4vJfaMKA13n6fsd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17858.5,
      "width": 146.24,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 761659528,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 625407045,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DP et DR",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DP et DR",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "k1umEIFcP5VMjEzpVKmn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 17886.5,
      "width": 755.2,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "wk20qEPUsUC32VwK1RmN"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 348054514,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 639045585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question : pour T48, prend-on le taux de la victime à son entrée, ou son dernier taux de\nl'année ?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Question : pour T48, prend-on le taux de la victime à son entrée, ou son dernier taux de\nl'année ?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
