      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "La retraite anticipée des nouveaux (T42)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "La retraite anticipée des nouveaux (T42)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qEjleQmDDIexGhkvTmLT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 18130.5,
      "width": 804.96,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nqwpb1pY53JDilk9Sryp"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 275390444,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1129895863,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : une pension de vieillesse prise avant l'âge normal de la retraite. T42 n'a pas de\nligne par type de pension.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : une pension de vieillesse prise avant l'âge normal de la retraite. T42 n'a pas de\nligne par type de pension.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lFiEOWPWH6B0eJDUGftn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 18178.5,
      "width": 773.44,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nqwpb1pY53JDilk9Sryp"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 75500929,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1852094090,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : une prestation RPRA (TPE_CODE), la première de la personne, saisie dans\nl'année (PE_DATE_INSERT).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : une prestation RPRA (TPE_CODE), la première de la personne, saisie dans\nl'année (PE_DATE_INSERT).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xrw3mOOv6IVI3F3BiypE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 18226.5,
      "width": 684.6400000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nqwpb1pY53JDilk9Sryp"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 518702217,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1824996836,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on la compte dans T42, avec les nouveaux retraités de vieillesse.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on la compte dans T42, avec les nouveaux retraités de vieillesse.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WIEe8qMuVdYHvr6g8C18",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 18254.5,
      "width": 798.4000000000001,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nqwpb1pY53JDilk9Sryp"
      ],
