      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les rentiers décédés (T57)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les rentiers décédés (T57)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YgDwsQHibHT7afBYAzm8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 20660.5,
      "width": 782.4000000000001,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mciWow783X696SP8rHmR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 21859333,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 167135107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : une rente radiée est une rente arrêtée, par exemple faute de certificat de vie.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : une rente radiée est une rente arrêtée, par exemple faute de certificat de vie.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SIMIouA3sR0FU8U6QH68",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 20688.5,
      "width": 796.48,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mciWow783X696SP8rHmR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 86982455,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 280102271,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : les rentes (PRESTATION_ESP, codes ARI, ARSV, ARSF, ARSE, ARSA), leur\nradiation (PE_DATE_RADIATION) et le décès du titulaire (INDIVIDU,\nIND_DATE_DECES).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : les rentes (PRESTATION_ESP, codes ARI, ARSV, ARSF, ARSE, ARSA), leur\nradiation (PE_DATE_RADIATION) et le décès du titulaire (INDIVIDU,\nIND_DATE_DECES).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3t2bAKimKVgBLUljL4mU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 20756.5,
      "width": 777.2800000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mciWow783X696SP8rHmR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1880402430,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 661328125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : T57 compte le rentier dont la rente est en cours à son décès : non radiée, ou\nradiée au plus tôt 31 jours avant.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : T57 compte le rentier dont la rente est en cours à son décès : non radiée, ou\nradiée au plus tôt 31 jours avant.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uur9SeTdQZQRS4NFFCJY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 20804.5,
      "width": 770.4000000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "mciWow783X696SP8rHmR"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
