      "seed": 1167233117,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 797405629,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les paiements sans effet",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les paiements sans effet",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "benjW8NSmOgoG8R2X3xW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 22128.5,
      "width": 765.7600000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "AFVme2HUDbBKMF3qlIYf"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 950771129,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1557820599,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : un paiement sans effet est approuvé et comptabilisé, mais aucun titre ne dit\ncomment l'argent a été versé.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : un paiement sans effet est approuvé et comptabilisé, mais aucun titre ne dit\ncomment l'argent a été versé.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7cE7Sn7XHEGtp21psGES",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 22176.5,
      "width": 804.32,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "AFVme2HUDbBKMF3qlIYf"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2044083301,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1177141469,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : un débours de paiement (DEB_TYPE = PM) au statut P (DEB_STATUT) n'a pas\nd'effet (EFFET). Ce circuit existe depuis 2019.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : un débours de paiement (DEB_TYPE = PM) au statut P (DEB_STATUT) n'a pas\nd'effet (EFFET). Ce circuit existe depuis 2019.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cGGDf9KHIaVSR91Dv4PG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 22224.5,
      "width": 783.36,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "AFVme2HUDbBKMF3qlIYf"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 813580694,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 807690686,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on les compte comme payés. Mais le virement est un type d'effet (BVB) : sans\neffet, on ne sait pas si le paiement a été viré, alors que le recueil des besoins demande la\npart payée par virement.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on les compte comme payés. Mais le virement est un type d'effet (BVB) : sans\neffet, on ne sait pas si le paiement a été viré, alors que le recueil des besoins demande la\npart payée par virement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HjC4oxDdguMAuJl6PWjR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 22292.5,
      "width": 736.1600000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "AFVme2HUDbBKMF3qlIYf"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7861962,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1075438193,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : 62 % des paiements des prestations familiales de 2025 n'ont pas d'effet de\npaiement.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : 62 % des paiements des prestations familiales de 2025 n'ont pas d'effet de\npaiement.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MZV0twKBqKuSrLrL1R0t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 897.0,
      "y": 22340.5,
      "width": 101.76,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "AFVme2HUDbBKMF3qlIYf"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 120929347,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 203847477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "À qui : DSI",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "À qui : DSI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
