      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L'agence d'un dossier",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'agence d'un dossier",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HAtesHMVDNJZaP9izPmO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 24004.5,
      "width": 782.72,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nethimS022HTXFvEclV8"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2098218123,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 580116868,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : le recueil des besoins veut les délais, les taux et les effectifs par direction\nrégionale et par agence.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : le recueil des besoins veut les délais, les taux et les effectifs par direction\nrégionale et par agence.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b7y0TEUg7ts31KaErMCV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 24052.5,
      "width": 802.5600000000001,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nethimS022HTXFvEclV8"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1683153869,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 554030461,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : le service du dossier (DOSSIER, SP_NO), sinon celui de sa réception\n(RECEPTION_DOSSIER, SP_NO). La liste est SERVICE_PROVINCIAL : 15 agences et les\n5 sièges des directions régionales.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : le service du dossier (DOSSIER, SP_NO), sinon celui de sa réception\n(RECEPTION_DOSSIER, SP_NO). La liste est SERVICE_PROVINCIAL : 15 agences et les\n5 sièges des directions régionales.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wiKSik9Il9WkwNH0XPW3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 24120.5,
      "width": 712.96,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nethimS022HTXFvEclV8"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1745397308,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1849511940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : on range chaque demande à l'agence de son dossier, sinon à celle de sa\nréception.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : on range chaque demande à l'agence de son dossier, sinon à celle de sa\nréception.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SClacwjQ5u2ss3dva6vI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755.0,
      "y": 24168.5,
      "width": 804.0,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "nethimS022HTXFvEclV8"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1436679944,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1842600778,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794218137525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 cite 16 agences. Quatre d'entre elles sont inactives dans la\nbase (SP_ACTIVE = N) : Tanghin, Sakaby, Diapaga, Tougan.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : l'annuaire CNSS 2024 cite 16 agences. Quatre d'entre elles sont inactives dans la\nbase (SP_ACTIVE = N) : Tanghin, Sakaby, Diapaga, Tougan.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
